      "data": {
        "text": "**Constructing Profile Claims**\n\nI'm now diving into `profile_claims.py`. The plan is to fetch and normalize federated user profile claims. I'll be using the access token obtained earlier in `oauth_callback.py` to do this. I am now proceeding with this component.\n\n\n",
