        "text": "**Implementing PKCE Login**\n\nI'm now diving into the implementation of `pkce_login.py`. The focus is on crafting a PKCE login flow specifically tailored for public clients using Google's services. I'm keen on ensuring a secure and streamlined authentication experience.\n\n\n",
